    "files into public/photos/ under the same keys, delete the matching entries",
    "here, and re-run `npm run photos:fetch`. No component changes.",
    "",
    "key       the filename stem. public/photos/<key>-<width>.<format>",
    "role      product | detail | wide | room | editorial | hero | og.",
    "          Decides the crop aspect and the width ladder. See fetch.mjs.",
    "slug      the catalogue product this belongs to, or null for a page image.",
    "tint      shown while the file downloads. Use the product's accent colour",
    "          from src/data/catalogue.ts so the placeholder reads as the product.",
    "alt       required, and written to be useful on its own. It is what a screen",
    "          reader announces and what a failed load leaves behind."
